    "within": "Questions 1 to 3 tap-count a tidy row of 6, then 7, then 8. Question 4 counts 9 on a tens-frame. Question 5 builds a group of 10. Question 6 says what comes next after 7, 8, 9. Question 7 picks the missing amount in 6, 7, blank, 9, 10. Question 8 orders 6, 7, 8. Question 9 shows 6 and asks the child to tap the matching group. Question 10 picks which group has 10. Counts climb 6 to 10 with no drop-back.",
    "versus": "Easy: tidy rows of 6 to 10, tap to count, hints on the first three. Medium uses scattered groups and tens-frames. Hard mixes in extra objects to ignore, a numeral match, and a fuller order, still within 10."
